      "text": "Selected Answer: D. Not sure why I'd choose C over D, my choice is D. Model is already deployed to us-central1 so now it's only a matter of deploying it to asia-southeast1 and letting the app choose the closer endpoint. Why the need for private endpoints and what will happen with the current already deployed model in us-central1?"
