      "text": "Selected Answer: B. Cloud Build Integration: Cloud Build is Google Cloud's fully managed CI/CD platform, designed to automate builds and deployments, making it ideal for this task. Trigger on Code Pushes: Setting the trigger event to \"Push to a branch\" ensures that the pipeline automatically activates whenever new code is pushed to any branch of the repository, aligning with the goal of retraining models on code modifications."
