  "correctRationale": "Vertex AI Pipelines caches a component's results when its inputs and definition are unchanged. Naming every component file with a datetime stamp makes each spec unique, so caching never hits; fixed filenames let the expensive export and preprocess steps reuse cached outputs and cut development cost.",
