      "text": "Selected Answer: C. Feature attribution is supported for all types of models (both AutoML and custom-trained), frameworks (TensorFlow, scikit, XGBoost), BigQuery ML models, and modalities (images, text, tabular, video). https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/docs/explainable-ai/overview"
