      "user": "OpenKnowledge",
      "text": "Selected Answer: C. The current model receives about 20 prediction requests per hour with an average response time of one second -- this clearly indicates autoscaling is not an issue for current model although 20 requests per hour is not even close to use the full capacity for the full hours. So, it's look like the new model is taking 180 seconds to respond is not due to not having a node running all the time."
