    "Wrong: Fixed precision-at-recall optimizes one operating point, not overall quality.",
    "Correct: AUC PR targets the rare class precision-recall tradeoff — built for imbalanced detection.",
    "Wrong: AUC ROC looks good on imbalanced data even when minority performance is poor."
